  {
   "id": "t_6886176e804d2abe06f5",
   "sourceHash": "6886176e804d2abe06f58cb93e1ddabc3e99c26c35c65cc8c94c594c8b4593cc",
   "text": "首席医师兼科室主任 · 自2010年起执业",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1ec8b4e3d623f340bf38",
   "sourceHash": "1ec8b4e3d623f340bf386f276f69bdce40d98516e9c73b561c58bb21dd8700e2",
   "text": "阿育吠陀疗法旨在恢复体内多沙（dosha）的平衡。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9a1c48d7339a97710a1c",
   "sourceHash": "9a1c48d7339a97710a1c037eebf7219e8cfd03cb248ea6851bb9ae41f84d8a18",
   "text": "阿育吠陀疗法旨在恢复体内多沙（dosha）的平衡",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_45484e7fd1cc254856e7",
   "sourceHash": "45484e7fd1cc254856e7bbbbc65d7c5d115ca5abb4aa35b9509392a6456d7bb2",
   "text": "我们的整体护理理念将舒适、情绪健康与个人护理需求置于核心。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dfd0ab6fcf558203213e",
   "sourceHash": "dfd0ab6fcf558203213e5996cbeecdc9038fab1c5e4042165ada64bc0004ad2f",
   "text": "我们的整体护理理念将舒适、情绪健康与个人护理需求置于核心",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_36f2eab50689ba30262a",
   "sourceHash": "36f2eab50689ba30262a22b2593d66cd66d9cbe99d301c3badb0dde6e86a6a13",
   "text": "我们致力于通过兼顾身体舒适与情绪健康的关怀护理，支持患者的生活质量。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_99acbe96376cd1ab520a",
   "sourceHash": "99acbe96376cd1ab520afa5b792f2152533efcdbc69446fd4b910875057bc58d",
   "text": "我们致力于通过兼顾身体舒适与情绪健康的关怀护理，支持患者的生活质量",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1f8cfbfd511b9565e384",
   "sourceHash": "1f8cfbfd511b9565e38472cb603e6e898a67dd3413611f834cbd92c81b5cec7a",
   "text": "选择阿育吠陀，获得融合日常习惯、饮食与传统疗法的个性化调理方式。医师指导的护理会考虑您的个人需求与健康目标，而专门的住院安排让您有时间并获得支持，将这种方式付诸实践。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ee19dc55bdffb158a157",
   "sourceHash": "ee19dc55bdffb158a1570c610712e9902af0a6ad5f25215f5461b5cba931dcf2",
   "text": "阿育吠陀是至今仍在使用的最古老医学体系之一，并在持续得到研究和发展。其药物主要由草药和其他天然成分制成。天然并不意味着必然没有副作用，因此Kairali的每一种药物和疗法都由我们的医师开具并监测，他们会将您正在服用的药物和现有健康状况纳入考虑。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0d5d8f02a3f44092e860",
   "sourceHash": "0d5d8f02a3f44092e86085f33188a0bbe979389fdb06485162adff00d9e0d783",
   "text": "人们选择阿育吠陀，也是因为它为长期疾病提供个性化的调理方式。对于糖尿病等疾病，阿育吠陀护理侧重于饮食、日常作息、身体活动和疗法，并与您的常规医生所开的治疗配合进行；它不能替代处方药物，任何药物调整都应仅在您的医生建议下进行。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_159b82115c83e748efb3",
   "sourceHash": "159b82115c83e748efb3c7520160ef4de3e277730c569eb32e75799f6590ff76",
   "text": "进行草药粉按摩时，将草药粉涂抹于斜躺患者的全身",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_291e38060a2389abbf34",
   "sourceHash": "291e38060a2389abbf3478565d3c1dcc1bcd15e38448fbb76baf70d8cda01a83",
   "text": "直到不久前，阿育吠陀——“生命的科学”——还隐藏在我们的古代典籍之中。除了祖母们常常依赖的家庭“偏方”之外，大多数人几乎已忘记了它深远的益处。除了少数孜孜不倦地守护这门学科、并在一定程度上成功将阿育吠陀确立为一种替代治疗形式的人之外，我们中的许多人并不知道那其实就是“阿育吠陀”。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_21fe474ca86f94fac1fb",
   "sourceHash": "21fe474ca86f94fac1fbdf6a890a22ae58d19b79a113a2b13354288b7669b4d0",
   "text": "一位治疗师正在为患者背部涂抹温油按摩",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_31e2624db5823647890e",
   "sourceHash": "31e2624db5823647890ec47407a564d13112e19b332271994a0cd46ae8de035b",
   "text": "两位身穿卡萨武（kasavu）纱丽的治疗师正引导一位坐着的女士伸展双臂",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_402ca4a84ccb220411b8",
   "sourceHash": "402ca4a84ccb220411b81b7fa98d990a91efba8ba86d35c02c97c0b99e7138bd",
   "text": "一位治疗师在Nasya（鼻腔滴油疗法）中将药油滴入患者鼻孔，这是Panchakarma（五业疗法）的操作之一",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_824681536c58ff7379e3",
   "sourceHash": "824681536c58ff7379e36c0e812bb51384b5978f0bcdbb69b74d11474d74d8f2",
   "text": "两位治疗师从悬挂的黄铜器皿中将温油倾注于患者前额",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_94c6696ca1664e5fdfc7",
   "sourceHash": "94c6696ca1664e5fdfc75b2e1b026cf0973e488dd93736107036bb9413b72eae",
   "text": "温油从悬挂的黄铜器皿中流淌到患者前额",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c1f5555396dcbce4e1f1",
   "sourceHash": "c1f5555396dcbce4e1f13f179c75dd52552477d9f0ed46566df88239903b2dfe",
   "text": "油按摩过程中，两位治疗师轻柔地伸展斜躺患者的手臂",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4be9bd95628c47dd4893",
   "sourceHash": "4be9bd95628c47dd489343a1d6cfb9716429bc5e899d55a0fb1dc63245ab1e25",
   "text": "一群人在树下草坪上练习站立瑜伽",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cb5a39a288c34205307a",
   "sourceHash": "cb5a39a288c34205307a1fceee3fdb3cea697dd08d503dfcb0a94b5d1c356fe0",
   "text": "一位瑜伽老师在垫子上为做眼镜蛇式的女士调整颈部和肩部姿势",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_07f26ab2553d9b95aa68",
   "sourceHash": "07f26ab2553d9b95aa68343ad81a761e125b739f1fcf4d2d907f93d9f87d6879",
   "text": "一群人盘腿坐在草坪上，双臂高举过头做瑜伽体式",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
